sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Patient browser
  participant C as Convex + Better Auth
  participant W as Cloudflare Worker
  participant R as Private R2
  participant G as Caregiver browser

  P->>P: Detect objects and maintain rolling 5-second buffer
  P->>P: Confirm movement/object event or temporal fall
  P->>C: Request authenticated one-use write grant
  C-->>P: Expiring token + immutable household key
  P->>W: Upload selected frame/clip with token
  W->>C: Consume grant through server secret
  C-->>W: Authorized key and content type
  W->>R: Store private evidence
  P->>C: Save structured memory or alert with R2 key
  C-->>G: Realtime household update
  G->>C: Request one-use read grant
  G->>W: Read evidence with token
  W->>C: Consume and authorize linked key
  W->>R: Fetch object
  R-->>G: Private no-store media
